tamp": "2026-03-06T06:59:53Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "5. The meeting between Mahatma Gandhi and X in December 1931 remains one of the most surreal chapters of Gandhi’s life. X was known for his \"power desk\" at the far end of a long room to intimidate visitors. Gandhi, unfazed, walked the length of the hall with his usual brisk pace.\nGandhi was a shrewd judge of character. After the meeting, he didn't comment much on X’s politics to the press, but in a private letter to Romain Rolland, he gave a chillingly accurate description of the dictator:\n\"X is a riddle to me. Many of his reforms attract me. He seems to have done a great deal for the peasantry. Of course, the iron glove is there. But as the fist is coated with velvet, one does not feel the pressure... His eyes are like the eyes of a cat.”", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-06T07:00:09Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Smuts", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-06T07:00:09Z", "username": "Dr.Namrata Srinivasan", "text": "Hitler", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-06T07:00:12Z", "username": "Dr.Namrata Srinivasan", "text": "Stalin p", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-06T07:00:15Z", "username": "Dr.Namrata Srinivasan", "text": "Mussolini", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-06T07:00:16Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Close", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-06T07:00:25Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "oh wow what a lurn", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-06T07:00:32Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "great crack",